parts-notes.md:3:> **Design version 7 (2026-11-11, architecture 17.29 and 17.30): these files are NOT yet v7.** The lead regenerates them from the inside model v7. Until then, do not make from the folders `light-guide/` and `light-plug/` (both parts removed in v7), `joystick-nub/` and `joystick-frame/` (the rectangular joystick, removed in v7: the v7 cap CAP1 and frame FRM1 are round, specs/joystick-nub.md), or from the hole in `main-board/` (removed in v7: the board has no hole, specs/main-board.md). The other files are unchanged by v7 except the body, whose round 5.60 joystick opening (exterior merged32h) is not in these STEP files.
parts-notes.md:25:- **cover-glass** (STEP): the exterior's formed glass. Its print has no opening in v7 (the print window is removed in v7); the print is not geometry.
parts-notes.md:26:- **joystick-nub** (STEP and STL): v6.2 shape, the rectangular nub removed in v7, with its 6.9 x 6.4 x 0.4 flange, placed at the US 9 position (-78 deg). Replaced in v7 by the round cap CAP1 (specs/joystick-nub.md); a print of this file is not the v7 part.
parts-notes.md:27:- **joystick-frame** (STEP): v6.2 shape, the rectangular 6.4 x 5.4 frame removed in v7. Replaced in v7 by the round frame FRM1, a separate turned titanium part (specs/joystick-nub.md).
parts-notes.md:28:- **main-board** (STEP): the bare board core with the antenna notch, and a hole that is removed in v7 (the light guide hole; the v7 board has no hole). No mask, pads, copper or parts: a board house needs Gerber and drill files.
parts-notes.md:29:- **light-guide**, **light-plug** (STEP): LG1 and LP1, both removed in v7 (architecture 17.30). Do not make them.
mfg-notes.md:8:Per ring size US 7 to 13: body with every inside pocket cut (STEP, STL), band liner (STEP, STL), cell pouch, both flex tails, the joystick stiffener, the joystick dam, the glass seal, the motor window seal (US 7, 8, 9), and a whole-ring assembly STEP. Once: cover glass, joystick cap with its 6.9 flange (STEP, STL), joystick frame, main board, microphone gaskets and membranes; in v6.2 also the light guide LG1 and light plug LP1, both removed in v7. Design version 7 (architecture 17.29, 17.30): the joystick files and the board's hole are v6.2 shapes removed in v7, and the light files must not be made; the lead regenerates the files from the inside model v7 (parts-notes.md). 90 files in `parts/index.csv`; `check_parts.py` ends `RESULT PASS files=90`.
